，兼具CGI渲染的精细度与电影摄影的质感。画面细节丰富，从宇航服的褶皱到远处建筑的线条都清晰可见，整体呈现出高对比度、高饱和度的史诗感。\n\n**文字与Logo：**\n顶部有醒目的橙色渐变Logo \"llama.cpp\"，下方是巨大的白色加粗汉字 \"提示词反推\"，底部有一行较小的白色说明文字。字体现代、醒目，与科幻背景融合。\n\n**参数建议：**\n8k, ultra-detailed, cinematic lighting, volumetric fog, octane render, unreal engine 5, hyper-realistic, wide angle, depth of field."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 8, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 10, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "size": [270, 78], "pos": [3979.998779296875, 605.5770874023438], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 29, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 11}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "pixaromaGroups": [], "ds": {"offset": [-1035.5544154083823, 416.6451432650973], "scale": 0.45000000000000134}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "提示词撰写", "bounding": [518.5570068359375, 844.843994140625, 1446.437255859375, 950.5999755859375]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "图片提示词反推", "bounding": [2000.9412841796875, 60.497215270996094, 1794.7161865234375, 730.599853515625]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "视频提示词反推", "bounding": [2003.6873779296875, 841.7050170898438, 1792.4940185546875, 946.1553955078125]}], "links": [[1, 2, 0, 1, 0, "LLAMACPPMODEL"], [3, 4, 0, 1, 1, "LLAMACPPARAMS"], [4, 1, 0, 5, 0,